---
title: "An investor update, and what investors/lint flags"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: clean
    lg1: draft
    lg2: sent
    lg3: flagged
    lg4: fails
    lg5: broken
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 teal
  class lg3 yellow
  class lg4 orange
  class lg5 tan
  s0: Clean venture
  s1: Raise has no use of funds
  s2: A record is missing or broken
  s3: Clean venture, a rule is fail-closed
  s4: Draft update, unconfirmed numbers flagged
  s5: Terms conflict with alignment
  s6: Raise has no use of funds, run fails
  s7: Draft update, numbers confirmed
  s8: Sent update, unconfirmed numbers flagged
  s9: Draft update, unconfirmed numbers, run fails
  s10: Terms conflict with alignment, run fails
  s11: Sent update, numbers confirmed
  s12: Sent update, unconfirmed numbers, run fails
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you record a raise with no use of funds
  s0 --> s2: a record is missing or not valid JSON
  s0 --> s3: you set a rule fail-closed [while nothing is flagged]
  s0 --> s4: you draft an update with unconfirmed numbers
  s0 --> s5: you record terms a principle forbids
  s1 --> s0: you add a use of funds
  s1 --> s2: the raise decision is not valid JSON
  s1 --> s6: you set the raise rule fail-closed
  s2 --> s0: you repair the record [the venture is clean again]
  s3 --> s0: you set the rule fail-open
  s4 --> s7: you confirm the numbers
  s4 --> s8: you send the update
  s4 --> s9: you set the update rule fail-closed
  s5 --> s0: you change the terms to match alignment
  s5 --> s10: you set the terms rule fail-closed
  s2 --> s1: you repair the record [the raise finding returns]
  s6 --> s1: you set the rule fail-open
  s7 --> s11: you send the update
  s8 --> s11: you confirm the numbers
  s8 --> s12: you set the update rule fail-closed
  s9 --> s4: you set the rule fail-open
  s9 --> s7: you confirm the numbers
  s9 --> s12: you send the update
  s10 --> s5: you set the rule fail-open
  s12 --> s8: you set the rule fail-open
  s12 --> s11: you confirm the numbers
  class s0 teal
  class s1 yellow
  class s2 tan
  class s3 teal
  class s4 yellow
  class s5 yellow
  class s6 orange
  class s7 blue
  class s8 yellow
  class s9 orange
  class s10 orange
  class s11 teal
  class s12 orange
